{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115365","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115365/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115365/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115365/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115365","id":3853629126,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7lsbbG","number":115365,"title":"Accented characters (ñ, á, é, etc.) render incorrectly in pixel fonts in Godot 4.6 RC1/RC2","user":{"login":"nuevocharrua","id":24524075,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTI0MDc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24524075?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nuevocharrua","html_url":"https://github.com/nuevocharrua","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nuevocharrua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nuevocharrua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nuevocharrua/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nuevocharrua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nuevocharrua/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nuevocharrua/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nuevocharrua/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nuevocharrua/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nuevocharrua/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-01-25T17:58:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T08:03:34Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n<img width=\"940\" height=\"290\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/14dd422e-bd6a-4c73-a870-5054021c8841\" />\nIn Godot **4.6 RC1** and **RC2,** accented characters such as “ñ” or letters with diacritics render incorrectly when using pixel fonts (e.g. Fusion Pixel Font).\n\n\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS 26.2 Godot 4.6 rc2\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe accent marks appear misaligned or broken, as if they were rendered as separate combining glyphs instead of a single precomposed character.\n\nAdditionally, there is a slight misalignment in paragraph_separation when working with pixel-art fonts.\nThis offset is very subtle and mostly noticeable in pixel-art UIs, where spacing is expected to be perfectly grid-aligned.\n\nBoth issues are especially noticeable in pixel-art interfaces and localized text, where visual precision is critical.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new empty project.\n- Configure the project for pixel-art rendering:\n- Go to Project Settings → Display → Window.\n  - Set a low base resolution (e.g. 320×180 or 480×270).\n  - Set Stretch Mode to viewport.\n  - Set Stretch Aspect to keep.\n- Add a Label or RichTextLabel to a scene.\n- Assign a pixel font (e.g. Fusion Pixel Font) to the control.\n- Set the text to include accented characters, for example:\n\n```\nmontaña\nacción\nespañol\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[pixel-font-issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24847711/pixel-font-issue.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115365/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115365/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}